## Java 코드

```java
String str = "Lucky Boy";
int score = 0;
for (int i = 0; i < str.length(); i++) {  
    char ch = str.charAt(i); 
    if (ch >= 'A' && ch <= 'Z') {    
        score += ch - 'A' + 1;  
    }
}
System.out.println(score);
```

## JavaScript 코드

```JavaScript
let str = "Lucky Boy";
let score = 0;

for (let i = 0; i < str.length; i++) {
    let ch = str[i];
    if (ch >= "A" && ch <= "Z") {
        score += ch.charCodeAt(0) - "A".charCodeAt(0) + 1;
    }
}

console.log(score);
```

